3. Prohibited without the Licensor's prior written consent

  Unless the Licensor has given You separate prior written consent (for example a commercial
  license), You may not:
  (a) use, install or run the Software by, for, on behalf of, or on any device owned, managed or
      provided by an Organization, including inside a business, office, school or public authority;
  (b) use the Software for any commercial purpose or for any purpose connected with paid work,
      including providing services to others;
  (c) sell, rent, lease or otherwise charge for the Software or any Modification, or include it in
      any product, service, bundle or distribution;
  (d) distribute, publish or make available any Modification, or any part of the Software separately;
  (e) offer the Software or any Modification as a hosted, online or network service;
  (f) use the Software, its detection rules, heuristics, scoring logic or reports to build, train,
      improve or benchmark any other security product or machine-learning model;
  (g) remove, alter or obscure any copyright notice, license text or attribution;
  (h) use the name "Cerber", the Licensor's name or any confusingly similar name for any
      Modification or derived product.

